%% title: A substitute teacher covers one day only
%% desc: The Admin picks a date, a section and a period. Then they either give a substitute teacher or cancel the period. The weekly routine does not change. The substitute teacher sees the period in My routine on that day.
flowchart LR
  A["Date → section → period"]:::admin --> Q{"What happens?"}:::note
  Q -- "someone else teaches" --> S["Pick a substitute teacher"]:::admin
  Q -- "nobody teaches" --> X["Cancel the period"]:::admin
  S --> T["Substitute teacher's<br/>My routine that day"]:::teacher
  S -.-> W["Weekly routine<br/>stays as it was"]:::note
  X -.-> W
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
